<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Map图像源EnumerationG实际调用链</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#101a29;color:#e7edf7;font:16px/1.8 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#9fd5ff}nav{position:sticky;top:0;background:#172638;padding:12px;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}pre{overflow:auto;background:#09131f;padding:16px}code{font:13px/1.7 Consolas,monospace}table{border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow:auto}td,th{border:1px solid #45617e;padding:8px 12px}blockquote{border-left:4px solid #e7b667;margin:18px 0;padding:1px 16px;background:#203249}h1,h2,h3,h4{scroll-margin-top:85px}img{max-width:100%}.meta{font-size:12px;color:#a9bfd3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}summary{cursor:pointer}</style><nav><a href="../../../framework-architecture.html">主架构</a><a href="../../main-ui-map.html">逆向核心</a><a href="../index.html">关联文档目录</a><a data-source-download download href="../../../plugins/MAP-CALIBRATION-IMAGE-SOURCE-ENUMERATION-SOURCE.md">下载原始文件</a></nav><main><h1 id="map图像源enumerationg实际调用链">Map图像源EnumerationG实际调用链</h1><p>原Map XML ImageSource_0/1：Initers GetFrontParamItemsOperation(IMAGE)写EnumEntrys、GetSelectedCombinationOperation读InputImage1/2；CurValue触发SetCombinationSourceOperation。原Apps.XmlParser GetFrontParamItemsOperation.Operate调用VmModule.GetFrontIOWithLeafItemsByName(type)，把返回IList设置父节点TargetName+A。VM.Core.VmModule.cs4049起取GetFrontParamItems，加原global13000/localvariable，父模块输入或前序模块输出GetAllCombinationByType，过滤CanSubscribeA&amp;&amp;Visible，返回ModulePathName字符串。既有共享typed订阅服务承担引用身份，产品不从caption解析身份。</p>
<p>当前共享ConfigurationSubscriptionValidation.FromElement能读EnumerationG的该Initers，正确建立Combination/InputImage1/2及IMAGE过滤；ToolConfigurationSubscriptionControls.ImageEnumeration真实ComboBox DropDownOpened直接service.Enumerate(query)，SelectionChanged直接service.Bind+State.ApplySubscription，因此控件可独立于State.Choices运作。但Map dispatcher缺EnumerateInputs，State.Initialize原Initers先得到UnsupportedOperation。原真实Host和后注入SaveEditor都受影响；不能把它当“测试没服务”。</p>
<p>有限专属候选仅照已生产Board同族分支处理Map EnumerateInputs：FromElement→context.ConfigurationSubscriptions.Enumerate→Handled或明确错误；控件继续消费typed tree，不添加caption identity或第二套枚举。候选640EA2B...等根线统一短窗应用。新增真实Host测试从前序Source A/B两IMAGE候选通过真实WPF ComboBox绑定两侧，不再doc.Connect图像捷径；仍保留POINT组合、完整运行与Save/load/release断言，新增State无GetFrontParamItemsOperation Unsupported。当前新测试未构建。</p>
<h2 id="根线源码退出校正必须运输并消费初始化结果">根线源码退出校正：必须运输并消费初始化结果</h2><p>再次核对原Operate写EnumEntrysA=list，单纯Enumerate后返回Handled仍丢弃结果，不能据下拉后查询成功声明Initers赋值复现。上述640EA候选仅是中间分派切片，根线将补共享typed SubscriptionTree result→State节点保存→ImageEnumeration初建加载，Board和相关provider返回原查询tree。当前源码冻结，等待根线短窗。Host已新增实际每侧下拉<strong>打开前</strong>Items含前序IMAGE A/B typed候选，再打开刷新并选择；新版未运行。原中间Host21不变，工具仍未完整。</p>
<p class="meta">来源：docs/plugins/MAP-CALIBRATION-IMAGE-SOURCE-ENUMERATION-SOURCE.md · SHA256 29611d46da9195e8284e63e1ef4931db6d53c2ef15eb8e0292aa02285501f11f<br>本页只转换阅读格式，结论与历史进度保留原文。</p></main></html>